  "page": "page-04",
  "idea": "Cobalt: clean, ad-free video and audio downloader with no paywalls",
  "text": "This open-source tool lets you grab clips and audio in pristine quality for free. Screen recording social media clips leaves you with choppy framerates, ugly interface buttons, and muffled sound. Most web downloaders lock crisp resolutions behind expensive paywalls or crush files with ugly compression. Cobalt bypasses paywalls by downloading raw source streams from YouTube, Instagram, and Reddit completely free. You secure crisp four-k footage for your edits.",
